{
  "archetype": "incident_change_control",
  "display_name": "Change Controlled Operations",
  "family": "controlled",
  "summary": "Risk assessed, CAB approved change lifecycle for production infrastructure and migrations.",
  "template_version": "2026.10",
  "states": [
    {
      "key": "change_request",
      "name": "Change Request",
      "category": "backlog",
      "initial": true,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "risk_assessment",
      "name": "Risk Assessment",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 24,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": [
        "Impact and blast radius documented",
        "Risk rating assigned"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "cab_review",
      "name": "Change Advisory Board Review",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 72,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "scheduled",
      "name": "Scheduled",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "implementing",
      "name": "Implementing",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 3,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "post_implementation_review",
      "name": "Post Implementation Review",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 72,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "closed",
      "name": "Closed",
      "category": "done",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "rolled_back",
      "name": "Rolled Back",
      "category": "blocked",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "rejected",
      "name": "Rejected",
      "category": "cancelled",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "key": "assess",
      "name": "Assess",
      "from": "change_request",
      "to": "risk_assessment",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "submit_to_cab",
      "name": "Submit to cab",
      "from": "risk_assessment",
      "to": "cab_review",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "risk_rating"
        },
        {
          "type": "linked_artifact",
          "artifact": "implementation_plan"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "cab_rejects",
      "name": "Cab rejects",
      "from": "cab_review",
      "to": "rejected",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "rejection_reason"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "cab_requests_rework",
      "name": "Cab requests rework",
      "from": "cab_review",
      "to": "risk_assessment",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "schedule",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "from": "cab_review",
      "to": "scheduled",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "change_advisory_board",
          "min_approvals": 2,
          "distinct_from_author": true
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "emergency_change",
      "name": "Emergency change",
      "from": "change_request",
      "to": "implementing",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "emergency_change_authority",
          "min_approvals": 1,
          "distinct_from_author": true
        },
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "incident_reference"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "begin_implementation",
      "name": "Begin implementation",
      "from": "scheduled",
      "to": "implementing",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "change_window_open"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "complete_implementation",
      "name": "Complete implementation",
      "from": "implementing",
      "to": "post_implementation_review",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "roll_back",
      "name": "Roll back",
      "from": "implementing",
      "to": "rolled_back",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "notify",
          "audience": "service_owner"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "replan_after_rollback",
      "name": "Replan after rollback",
      "from": "rolled_back",
      "to": "risk_assessment",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "close_change",
      "name": "Close change",
      "from": "post_implementation_review",
      "to": "closed",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "pir_outcome"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "key": "freeze_window_enforcement",
      "event": "transition_requested",
      "condition": "transition == 'begin_implementation' and calendar.freeze_active",
      "action": "reject_transition;notify:change_manager",
      "description": "Prevents implementation during declared change freezes.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "health_check_auto_rollback",
      "event": "external_webhook",
      "condition": "monitoring.error_budget_burn > 2.0 and state == 'implementing'",
      "action": "transition:roll_back;page:on_call",
      "description": "Rolls back automatically when error budget burn spikes.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "pir_reminder",
      "event": "time_in_state_exceeded",
      "condition": "state == 'post_implementation_review' and hours_in_state > 72",
      "action": "notify:change_manager",
      "description": "Chases overdue post implementation reviews.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "emergency_change_retro_review",
      "event": "transition_completed",
      "condition": "transition == 'emergency_change'",
      "action": "create_task:retrospective_cab_review",
      "description": "Forces retrospective CAB review of emergency changes.",
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "ceremonies": [
    {
      "name": "Change advisory board",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "change_advisory_board",
        "change_manager",
        "service_owner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Operational readiness review",
      "cadence": "per_change",
      "duration_minutes": 30,
      "participants": [
        "service_owner",
        "engineer"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "roles": [
    "change_manager",
    "change_advisory_board",
    "emergency_change_authority",
    "service_owner",
    "engineer",
    "on_call"
  ],
  "cadence": {
    "type": "change_windows",
    "standard_window": "weekday_evening",
    "freeze_calendar": true
  },
  "metrics": [
    "change_failure_rate",
    "mean_time_to_restore",
    "emergency_change_ratio",
    "change_lead_time"
  ],
  "anchors": {
    "intake": "change_request",
    "rework": "risk_assessment",
    "release_transition": "schedule",
    "done": "closed",
    "blocked": "rolled_back",
    "build_states": [
      "implementing"
    ],
    "review_states": [
      "cab_review",
      "post_implementation_review"
    ]
  },
  "description_text": "Workflow template: Change Controlled Operations (incident_change_control).\nRisk assessed, CAB approved change lifecycle for production infrastructure and migrations.\nStates in order: Change Request, Risk Assessment, Change Advisory Board Review, Scheduled, Implementing, Post Implementation Review, Closed, Rolled Back, Rejected.\nTransition Assess moves work from change_request to risk_assessment with no guard.\nTransition Submit to cab moves work from risk_assessment to cab_review with required field risk rating; linked implementation plan.\nTransition Cab rejects moves work from cab_review to rejected with required field rejection reason.\nTransition Cab requests rework moves work from cab_review to risk_assessment with no guard.\nTransition Schedule moves work from cab_review to scheduled with approval by 2 change advisory board.\nTransition Emergency change moves work from change_request to implementing with approval by 1 emergency change authority; required field incident reference.\nTransition Begin implementation moves work from scheduled to implementing with change window open.\nTransition Complete implementation moves work from implementing to post_implementation_review with no guard.\nTransition Roll back moves work from implementing to rolled_back with no guard.\nTransition Replan after rollback moves work from rolled_back to risk_assessment with no guard.\nTransition Close change moves work from post_implementation_review to closed with required field pir outcome.\nAutomation freeze_window_enforcement: Prevents implementation during declared change freezes.\nAutomation health_check_auto_rollback: Rolls back automatically when error budget burn spikes.\nAutomation pir_reminder: Chases overdue post implementation reviews.\nAutomation emergency_change_retro_review: Forces retrospective CAB review of emergency changes.\nCeremonies: Change advisory board, Operational readiness review.\nPrimary metrics: change failure rate, mean time to restore, emergency change ratio, change lead time."
}